{"id":201,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><style>@font-face{ font-family:\"Times New Roman\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"宋体\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Arial Unicode MS\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Wingdings\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"PingFang SC Regular\";} p.MsoNormal{ mso-style-name:正文; mso-style-parent:\"\"; margin-top:0.0000pt; margin-right:0.0000pt; margin-bottom:0.0000pt; margin-left:0.0000pt; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; text-align:left; font-family:'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family:'Arial Unicode MS'; letter-spacing:0.0000pt; font-size:12.0000pt;} span.10{ font-family:'Times New Roman';} span.15{ font-family:'Times New Roman'; text-decoration:underline; text-underline:single;} p.16{ mso-style-name:页眉与页脚; margin-top:0.0000pt; margin-right:0.0000pt; margin-bottom:0.0000pt; margin-left:0.0000pt; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; tab-stops:right blank 451.0000pt ; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; text-align:left; font-family:'PingFang SC Regular'; mso-fareast-font-family:'Arial Unicode MS'; mso-bidi-font-family:'Arial Unicode MS'; color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt; font-size:12.0000pt;} p.vsb_17{ mso-style-name:正文1; margin-top:0.0000pt; margin-right:0.0000pt; margin-bottom:0.0000pt; margin-left:0.0000pt; text-indent:0.0000pt; padding:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt ; mso-hyphenate:none; mso-pagination:none; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-family:'Arial Unicode MS'; color:rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing:0.0000pt; text-underline:rgb(0,0,0); font-size:10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} span.msoIns{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:underline; text-underline:single; color:blue;} span.msoDel{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:line-through; color:red;} table.MsoNormalTable{ mso-style-name:普通表格; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-para-margin:0pt; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.0000pt; mso-ansi-language:#0400; mso-fareast-language:#0400; mso-bidi-language:#0400;} table.18{ mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-para-margin:0pt; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.0000pt; mso-ansi-language:#0400; mso-fareast-language:#0400; mso-bidi-language:#0400;} @page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no; mso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{ margin-top:72.0000pt; margin-bottom:72.0000pt; margin-left:90.0000pt; margin-right:90.0000pt; size:595.0000pt 842.0000pt; mso-header-margin:0.0000pt; mso-footer-margin:0.0000pt; mso-header:url(\"vsb6FC2.files/header.html\") h0; mso-footer:url(\"vsb6FC2.files/header.html\") f0;} div.Section0{page:Section0;}</style><div><p>深化入团积极分子对共青团的认知认同，筑牢理想信念之基，2025年12月28日上午8：00，材料科学与工程学院团委于17301H教室开展2025年秋季入团积极分子培训团课。<br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nl7KPLlr7M49soORM2M8LaMR74MmvxbLRQVUz9YUmN8M8-0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDnkyaMkyinz7aLlCbnRVVnz6RLRrRUzlZUm7Zoz-4nzQFMNLbL7-8MNWFLzvZnz9Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYMm9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17268&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/86D045E101F9D1EE7C05CA58B18923E6/6C90B46B/178E8\" vheight=\"309\" vwidth=\"552\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nl7KPLlr7M49soORM2M8LaMR74MmvxbLRQVUz9YUmN8M8-0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDnkyaMkyinz7aLlCbnRVVnz6RLRrRUzlZUm7Zoz-4nzQFMNLbL7-8MNWFLzvZnz9Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYMm9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17268&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>团课伊始，全体人员起立奏唱团歌。随后，主持人宣读团课纪律要求，明确团课参与规范、课堂纪律准则、请假制度及奖惩激励规则，为团课有序开展奠定坚实基础。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/UmnK7M467nz-PLONlbolWfoRV2UmNxaU4rkLzUaLmN4nN70gihFp2hmCIa0MYhRU1yYM1ybnR9Pn7-aM8WRoz9YUNQVL7n2U8VVUlLbUm6FoRW7LRG8nlrFU8CDMlCJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYMm9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17268&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7CB269D81DB07BC982BFE0DFCAEAC9B7/82D004EE/CF65F\" vheight=\"369\" vwidth=\"554\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/LzQKfMmT7nRT2nONrVMl-PM4vDMR-xDU4rfUmGPo7LPnmv0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyPM1yPLSyYnmU8Lz-anlU4MRl8UNCDnNr2LmLaUm74nR6FMzVfUzlZoRAFnRGZM7-Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYMm9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17268&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>团委书记郝诗韵率先授课，以《中国共产主义青年团章程》为核心，系统阐释共青团总则、组织架构及校院团委发展历程，细致解读组织制度、纪律规范等核心内容，深入讲解团旗团徽的象征意义与团歌的精神内核，帮助学员夯实共青团理论根基。课堂上，通过朗读章程、互动提问等丰富形式，有效激发学员学习热情，深化对知识的理解与认同。此后，郝诗韵老师围绕“党的二十届四中全会精神”开展专题宣讲，重点解读“十五五”规划、“六个坚持”等核心要点，引导学员精准把握时代发展方向，将个人青春理想融入国家发展大局，增强新时代青年的使命担当。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nNUKanNLZUmGZoOlCZL77sLmnVU8WxRozQRL4TRnRGZU8U0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yaMkyiMYysL4vYLmUDUNMfL7-YL8LYnRV2nRnVM8C4MlnFUlnVM4vDM7QFLzV2nz-Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYMm9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17268&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/604577372246BCA0B23C2D1FD4E7F35D/ADE7764F/11FE2\" vheight=\"234\" vwidth=\"552\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nNUKanNLZUmGZoOlCZL77sLmnVU8WxRozQRL4TRnRGZU8U0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yaMkyiMYysL4vYLmUDUNMfL7-YL8LYnRV2nRnVM8C4MlnFUlnVM4vDM7QFLzV2nz-Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYMm9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17268&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>下午两点，李静老师以“初心不改，笃行不怠——争当新时代合格团员”为主题接续授课。她围绕共青团的初心使命、新时代青年的新使命及入团积极分子践行指南三大核心维度，深入阐释共青团的政治属性与基本任务，结合经典理论论述剖析青年在民族复兴进程中的时代担当，强调新时代共青团工作必须坚守的三大原则。从信念、实干、担当、品行四方面对入团积极分子提出具体践行要求，通过互动提问的形式引导学员深度思考，有效推动理论认知与实践要求深度融合。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/MmvKbM8V7U47PnOmWkM8VfUl7ZMNLxbU4TRL4GYozfkoll0gihFp2hmCIa0LYybnkhfU1h2nzfRU87bUmlbM8LYM7lYMmU4L7L8LN7DnRrFU4lDL8-8L8WFLln7L4LJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYMm9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17268&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/39DABFE0CCA9B597C24E26430C42A6D5/C563B43B/1DD33\" vheight=\"387\" vwidth=\"552\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/MmvKbM8V7U47PnOmWkM8VfUl7ZMNLxbU4TRL4GYozfkoll0gihFp2hmCIa0LYybnkhfU1h2nzfRU87bUmlbM8LYM7lYMmU4L7L8LN7DnRrFU4lDL8-8L8WFLln7L4LJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYMm9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17268&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>随后，云卓然同学以“以思想之旗引青春航向”为题开展分享宣讲。他立足马克思主义唯物史观回溯社会阶级矛盾演变，推导“两个必然”的科学结论，深入解读核心理论要义，系统梳理党的理论传承脉络，帮助学员夯实思想理论根基，引导大家自觉以党的科学理论指引青春航向、锚定奋斗坐标。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nRNKbUz9PMz74LOmVVnR98oRVkMR-xZnmA7U4LZo7Cso7C0gihFp2hmCIa0MSh2UYybM1hkMR-iMRT2nNQ2L7L4UmG8MmvDnNCZo7CPnmfFnNC4UNQ2M8VFLlWRollJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYMm9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17268&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5FC96B42549FFFF0C3B04676FF88F1F0/FF3BFF7A/1BC9E\" vheight=\"377\" vwidth=\"552\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nRNKbUz9PMz74LOmVVnR98oRVkMR-xZnmA7U4LZo7Cso7C0gihFp2hmCIa0MSh2UYybM1hkMR-iMRT2nNQ2L7L4UmG8MmvDnNCZo7CPnmfFnNC4UNQ2M8VFLlWRollJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYMm9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17268&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>此次团课圆满举办，有效夯实了学员共青团理论基础，明晰了青年使命担当，凝聚了青春动能。学院将持续优化团课内涵与形式，强化思想引领，引导广大青年以奋斗之姿书写青春答卷。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://3y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nl7KPLlr7M49soORM2M8LaMR74MmvxbLRQVUz9YUmN8M8-0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDnkyaMkyinz7aLlCbnRVVnz6RLRrRUzlZUm7Zoz-4nzQFMNLbL7-8MNWFLzvZnz9Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYMm9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17268&e=.png"}